Chef Vengeance presents the hero menu:&nbsp;

<strong style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Parse</strong> &nbsp;- Chrono-Ranger bits wrapped in a warm crispy Visionary croissant. <br style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" />&nbsp;

<strong style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Naturalist</strong> &nbsp;- A tastey Scholar based soup with all natural Haka chunks and Argent Adept spices. And noodles. Lots of noodles. <br style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" />&nbsp;

