<strong style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">KNYFE</strong> &nbsp;- A rotisserie style Ra marinated with Tempest juices with a slight hint of Expat to taste. <br style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" />&nbsp;

